      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 5.28,
          "en": "So, let's get back to those text form fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.28,
          "end": 7.11,
          "en": "And here, I wanna do two things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.11,
          "end": 8.52,
          "en": "I wanna add validation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.52,
          "end": 12.6,
          "en": "and I want to be able to get hold of the entered values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.6,
          "end": 14.58,
          "en": "Now, I'll start with validation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.58,
          "end": 16.65,
          "en": "And as you learned earlier in the course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.65,
          "end": 20.01,
          "en": "in the forms and handling user input section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.01,
          "end": 22.41,
          "en": "you can add this validator parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.41,
          "end": 24.69,
          "en": "to TextFormField widgets,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.69,
          "end": 26.67,
          "en": "and this then takes a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.67,
          "end": 28.32,
          "en": "which will automatically give you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.32,
          "end": 30.09,
          "en": "the currently entered value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.09,
          "end": 31.893,
          "en": "which will be a string or null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 32.91,
          "end": 35.97,
          "en": "And then in there, you can return an error message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 35.97,
          "end": 37.71,
          "en": "so you can return the string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 37.71,
          "end": 40.41,
          "en": "if you consider the value to be invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 40.41,
          "end": 43.38,
          "en": "And otherwise, you can return null",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 43.38,
          "end": 46.53,
          "en": "if the value should be treated as valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 46.53,
          "end": 48.42,
          "en": "So, therefore, here we can use a if statement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 48.42,
          "end": 51.67,
          "en": "to check if the value is equal to null maybe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 52.65,
          "end": 57.543,
          "en": "or if the value is empty, so if it's an empty string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.53,
          "end": 61.65,
          "en": "You also might want to call trim() on the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.65,
          "end": 64.2,
          "en": "before calling isEmpty to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.2,
          "end": 66.513,
          "en": "that excess white space is removed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.35,
          "end": 69.9,
          "en": "And here, since this is the email address input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.9,
          "end": 73.47,
          "en": "I also wanna add at least a basic check that ensures",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 73.47,
          "end": 76.44,
          "en": "that a valid email address was entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.44,
          "end": 78.63,
          "en": "Now, you could get more sophisticated here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.63,
          "end": 80.91,
          "en": "but here, I'll just check if not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 80.91,
          "end": 85.59,
          "en": "the value contains an @ symbol, so the @ character.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.59,
          "end": 90.12,
          "en": "If the entered text does not contain such a @ symbol,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.12,
          "end": 92.043,
          "en": "I consider it to be invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93,
          "end": 95.94,
          "en": "So, if either of these conditions here is met,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.94,
          "end": 98.75999999999999,
          "en": "and one of them is enough because of this OR operator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.75999999999999,
          "end": 102.213,
          "en": "that connects the conditions, I'll return an error message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.057,
          "end": 107.31,
          "en": "\"Please enter a valid email address.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.31,
          "end": 108.143,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 109.38,
          "end": 111.93,
          "en": "If we don't make it into this if check here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 111.93,
          "end": 114.27000000000001,
          "en": "we know that the value is valid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 114.27000000000001,
          "end": 116.613,
          "en": "and therefore then we should return null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 117.66,
          "end": 119.22,
          "en": "So, that's my validation logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 119.22,
          "end": 121.233,
          "en": "for the email address input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 122.07,
          "end": 124.8,
          "en": "Next up, let's work on the password field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.8,
          "end": 128.82,
          "en": "And here, I'll also add this validator parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 128.82,
          "end": 131.94,
          "en": "and add this function that gets a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.94,
          "end": 135.63,
          "en": "And here, I will copy this if statement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.63,
          "end": 137.763,
          "en": "from the email address input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.75,
          "end": 141.66,
          "en": "And I still wanna check whether value is null,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.66,
          "end": 145.02,
          "en": "but in addition, I'll also trim the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 145.02,
          "end": 147.39,
          "en": "and then check its length.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 147.39,
          "end": 149.13,
          "en": "And I wanna make sure that the length",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 149.13,
          "end": 151.47,
          "en": "is at least six characters long,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.47,
          "end": 154.23,
          "en": "so if it's less than six characters long,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 154.23,
          "end": 156.18,
          "en": "I wanna make it into this if statement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 156.18,
          "end": 158.37,
          "en": "and return an error message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 158.37,
          "end": 161.28,
          "en": "because the password should have a certain minimum length,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 161.28,
          "end": 163.38,
          "en": "which in my case here, will be six,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 163.38,
          "end": 165.6,
          "en": "also because that's the minimum length",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 165.6,
          "end": 168.063,
          "en": "that will be enforced by Firebase later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 169.2,
          "end": 170.03300000000002,
          "en": "So, here, I'll then say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 170.03300000000002,
          "end": 174.927,
          "en": "\"Password must be at least 6 characters long.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 176.19,
          "end": 178.07999999999998,
          "en": "And if we don't make it into this if check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 178.07999999999998,
          "end": 182.34,
          "en": "and the value is valid, I'll return null here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 182.34,
          "end": 183.723,
          "en": "So, that's the validation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 185.19,
          "end": 186.21,
          "en": "Of course, as mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 186.21,
          "end": 189.15,
          "en": "the goal also is to get hold of these entered values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 189.15,
          "end": 192.3,
          "en": "and for that, I'll add a brand new method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 192.3,
          "end": 195.39,
          "en": "to this AuthScreenState class here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 195.39,
          "end": 197.57999999999998,
          "en": "I'll name it _submit(),",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 197.57999999999998,
          "end": 199.443,
          "en": "and it will not return anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 200.43,
          "end": 201.81,
          "en": "And this should be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 201.81,
          "end": 204.81,
          "en": "whenever this ElevatedButton is pressed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 204.81,
          "end": 209.22,
          "en": "so I'll set submit here, _submit as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 209.22,
          "end": 211.203,
          "en": "for onPressed on that ElevatedButton.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 212.37,
          "end": 214.29,
          "en": "Now, in the end here in this submit() method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 214.29,
          "end": 216.36,
          "en": "I then wanna trigger my validators",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 216.36,
          "end": 220.41,
          "en": "and make sure that all the inputs are saved",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 220.41,
          "end": 223.07999999999998,
          "en": "and I get hold of the entered values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 223.07999999999998,
          "end": 224.94,
          "en": "And you learned that for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 224.94,
          "end": 227.883,
          "en": "you can essentially create a _formKey,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 229.35,
          "end": 232.14,
          "en": "which, in the end, is a GlobalKey",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 232.14,
          "end": 234.3,
          "en": "which will be connected to the FormState.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 234.3,
          "end": 238.98,
          "en": "And you learned about this GlobalKey, this _formKey here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 238.98,
          "end": 241.623,
          "en": "in the forms section earlier in the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 242.55,
          "end": 244.74,
          "en": "This global _formKey here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 244.74,
          "end": 247.83,
          "en": "can and should then be assigned as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 247.83,
          "end": 251.46,
          "en": "to the key parameter on the Form widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 251.46,
          "end": 253.68,
          "en": "And it's then through that _formKey",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 253.68,
          "end": 256.05,
          "en": "that we get access to the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 256.05,
          "end": 259.32,
          "en": "So, here in _submit(), we can use our _formKey here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 259.32,
          "end": 260.82,
          "en": "to get hold of the current state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 260.82,
          "end": 262.74,
          "en": "which, in the end, will be our FormState",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 262.74,
          "end": 265.41,
          "en": "and call validate for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 265.41,
          "end": 268.26,
          "en": "And actually, I'll just name it _form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 268.26,
          "end": 271.47,
          "en": "since this name makes a bit more sense to me than _formKey.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 271.47,
          "end": 274.68,
          "en": "But of course, the name in the end does not matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 274.68,
          "end": 277.23,
          "en": "But with that we got this _form property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 277.23,
          "end": 280.05,
          "en": "that holds the GlobalKey and is connected to the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 280.05,
          "end": 282.96,
          "en": "and we can then call validate() on that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 282.96,
          "end": 285.12,
          "en": "Now, I'll need to add an exclamation mark here, though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 285.12,
          "end": 287.79,
          "en": "to tell Dart that this will be set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 287.79,
          "end": 289.05,
          "en": "It will not be null",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 289.05,
          "end": 291.807,
          "en": "because we know that _submit() can only be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 291.807,
          "end": 293.7,
          "en": "via this ElevatedButton.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 293.7,
          "end": 295.89,
          "en": "And if that ElevatedButton is available,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 295.89,
          "end": 298.2,
          "en": "the form will be available as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 298.2,
          "end": 299.733,
          "en": "so it will not be null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 301.14,
          "end": 303.39,
          "en": "And of course, validate, as you learned earlier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 303.39,
          "end": 306.12,
          "en": "then returns a Boolean, which, in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 306.12,
          "end": 309.72,
          "en": "tells us whether the entered values are valid or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 309.72,
          "end": 311.31,
          "en": "Hence, I'll store that result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 311.31,
          "end": 315.33,
          "en": "of running my validators in a isValid variable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 315.33,
          "end": 318.51,
          "en": "a final variable which we can then use thereafter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 318.51,
          "end": 320.19,
          "en": "in that _submit() method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 320.19,
          "end": 323.22,
          "en": "because I can then check if isValid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 323.22,
          "end": 324.69,
          "en": "Alternatively, we could, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 324.69,
          "end": 328.56,
          "en": "also just grab that code and use that a condition here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 328.56,
          "end": 330.09,
          "en": "But here, I'll do it in two steps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 330.09,
          "end": 333.96,
          "en": "to keep the code slightly more structured and organized.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 333.96,
          "end": 337.23,
          "en": "And if my inputs are valid, I again wanna reach out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 337.23,
          "end": 340.947,
          "en": "to my _form.currentState, and I wanna call save().",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 342.06,
          "end": 344.13,
          "en": "And you might recall that save()",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 344.13,
          "end": 346.68,
          "en": "then triggers a special function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 346.68,
          "end": 349.653,
          "en": "that can be assigned to all those text form fields,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 350.73,
          "end": 354.21,
          "en": "the onSaved function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 354.21,
          "end": 357.753,
          "en": "so a function you assign to the onSaved parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 358.59000000000003,
          "end": 360.06,
          "en": "Now, this function then gets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 360.06,
          "end": 362.76,
          "en": "the currently entered value automatically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 362.76,
          "end": 366.78,
          "en": "and you can then do with that value whatever you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 366.78,
          "end": 370.2,
          "en": "For example, store it in a property of this class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 370.2,
          "end": 371.65,
          "en": "and that's what I'll do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 372.54,
          "end": 375.75,
          "en": "I'll add a new variable, _enteredEmail,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 375.75,
          "end": 378.27,
